  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\n(2x + 3y) : (4x - 7y) = 3 : 5\n\n⇒ (2x + 3y) / (4x - 7y) = 3 / 5​\n\n⇒ 5 (2x + 3y) = 3 (4x - 7y) ​\n\n⇒ 10x + 15y = 12x - 21y​\n\n⇒ 2x = 36y\n\n⇒ x / y = 36 / 2\n\n⇒ x : y = 18 : 1\n\n**So, x : y = 18 : 1**",
